{
  "name": "Facebook Public Group Posts & Buyer Recommendation Monitor (No Cookies)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Facebook Public Group Posts & Buyer Recommendation Monitor (No Cookies)\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nMonitor public Facebook groups for members asking for service providers, agencies, or software tools without account login.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/facebook-public-group-posts-comments-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/facebook-public-group-posts-comments-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Facebook Public Group Posts (No Cookies)** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "1388a114-2a87-42b5-ae9d-ada1d77ff7a9",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Facebook Public Group Posts (No Cookies)** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "02cea3ee-c11f-45b1-aa61-cd31e36a5f5f",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "85b7091b-593a-4f7c-ac34-3dfa71144c6e",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
